0,Hamer language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamer_language,"Hamer or Hamer-Banna (Hamer: hámar aapó) is a language within the South Omotic branch of the Afroasiatic language family. It is spoken primarily in southern Ethiopia by the Hamar people, Banna people, and by speakers of Karo.",Hamer-Banne,Afro-Asiatic
